#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/settings_window.py:583
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Den Default Country Code gëtt benotzt fir Zuelen ze formatéieren déi keen "
"internationale Präfix enthalen (z.B. +358).\n"
"\n"
"Wann et eidel gelooss gëtt, probéiert de System et automatesch vun Ärer SIM "
"Kaart oder Netzwierk z'entdecken.\n"
"\n"
"Dir kënnt et hei manuell iwwerschreiden andeems Dir en 2-Bréif ISO-"
"Regiounscode (z.B. US, FI, DE) oder en Uruffcode (z.B. +358, 358, +1, 1) "
"aginn."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/settings_window.py:593
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"De Ringback Toun ass den Toun gespillt (toot-toot-toot) wärend Dir waart op "
"en erausgaangen Uruff fir geäntwert ze ginn. E puer Carrièren generéieren et "
"net sou datt mir d'Méiglechkeet hunn et hei manuell ze generéieren. \n"
"\n"
"Dir kënnt Är eege Museksdatei auswielen, oder se läschen fir de Standard "
"System Toun ze benotzen."

